  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FINCA Haiti Financial Inclusion Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project consists of a senior loan facility for up to US$1.5 million to Fondation pour L&#x2019;Assistance Communautaire Internationale Haiti S.A. (&#x201C;FINCA Haiti&#x201D; or the &quot;Institution&quot;). The loan term will be up to three years, with semi-annual principal and interest payments. The loan proceeds will be used to grow the Institution&apos;s micro-finance and micro and small business portfolios, while encouraging financial inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
